{"id":1487,"title":"Python 中的`__init__`是什么？","summary":"Python 中的`__init__`是什么？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a241555d-ecd2-3344-9f82-faae4f4394d9","knowledge_id":169,"title":"Python 中的`__init__`是什么？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":169,"title":"Python 中的`__init__`是什么？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"04e47041-5b6f-3bcd-ac1c-6af66095d3c2","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中，`__init__() `是一个特殊的方法，用作类的**构造函数**。\n当我们创建一个类的对象时，这个方法会被**自动调用**。\n\n通常，所有的声明和初始化都在这个方法中完成。不需要明确地调用这个方法。\n\n让我们来看一个例子:","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中，<code>__init__()</code>是一个特殊的方法，用作类的<strong>构造函数</strong>。\n当我们创建一个类的对象时，这个方法会被<strong>自动调用</strong>。</p>\n<p>通常，所有的声明和初始化都在这个方法中完成。不需要明确地调用这个方法。</p>\n<p>让我们来看一个例子:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9046fdb7-f465-3c25-bff2-08b109499d38","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"class Person:\n    def __init__(self):\n        # 初始化方法，直接打印\n        print('inside __init__ method')\n\nobj = Person()\n\n# 输出:\n# inside __init__ method","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e508e24e-3022-3c0f-82f2-577c002c0b8f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"正如你所看到的，我们没有手动调用 `__init__()` 方法。当创建该类的对象时，该方法会被自动调用。","text_html":"<p>正如你所看到的，我们没有手动调用 <code>__init__()</code> 方法。当创建该类的对象时，该方法会被自动调用。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"92d8f4d3-d580-3b78-b515-5ee75602a2ed","text":"`__init__()` 方法也称为 `构造函数`，因为它用于构造对象。","text_html":"<p><code>__init__()</code> 方法也称为 <code>构造函数</code>，因为它用于构造对象。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1487"}
